python-sbom writes standardized CycloneDX Software Bill of Materials (SBOMs)
into Python wheel distributions, adhering to the PEP 770 specification.

The package integrates with Python build backends (such as Hatch, PDM, and
Setuptools) to record the project, its runtime dependencies, bundled wheels,
and the build toolchain. It ensures byte-for-byte reproducibility across builds
and provides utilities to manually embed or validate SBOMs within continuous
integration pipelines.
